# Avatar

Shows a user's image, and falls back to initials or an icon while the image loads or when it fails. Compose it from `Avatar`, `AvatarImage`, and `AvatarFallback`.

<Demo />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<script lang="ts">
	import { Avatar, AvatarImage, AvatarFallback } from "#lib/components/ui/avatar/index.js";
</script>

<Avatar>
	<AvatarImage src="https://github.com/shadcn.png" alt="@shadcn" />
	<AvatarFallback>CN</AvatarFallback>
</Avatar>
```

## Installation

```pm
npx remote0 add https://plainsv.com/r/avatar.json
```

## Anatomy

`Avatar` sets the frame and tracks whether the image has loaded. `AvatarImage` stays hidden until it loads, then covers the frame. `AvatarFallback` shows until then, and stays when the image fails or there is no `AvatarImage`. Changing `src` shows the fallback again while the new image loads.

## Fallback

The fallback can hold initials or an icon. Icons scale with the avatar size.

<Demo section="fallback" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<script lang="ts">
	import { Avatar, AvatarImage, AvatarFallback } from "#lib/components/ui/avatar/index.js";
	import { UserIcon } from "@lucide/svelte";
</script>

<Avatar>
	<AvatarImage src="/missing-avatar.png" alt="@missing" />
	<AvatarFallback>CN</AvatarFallback>
</Avatar>
<Avatar>
	<AvatarFallback><UserIcon /></AvatarFallback>
</Avatar>
```

## Variants

Set `variant` to `default`, `secondary`, or `outline`. The variant colors the fallback background, and `outline` adds a border that stays around the image.

<Demo section="variants" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Avatar variant="outline">
	<AvatarImage src="https://github.com/shadcn.png" alt="@shadcn" />
	<AvatarFallback>CN</AvatarFallback>
</Avatar>
```

## Sizes

Set `size` to `xs`, `sm`, `md`, or `lg`. The default is `sm`, a 32 pixel avatar like shadcn.

<Demo section="sizes" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Avatar size="lg">
	<AvatarImage src="https://github.com/shadcn.png" alt="@shadcn" />
	<AvatarFallback>CN</AvatarFallback>
</Avatar>
```

## Rounded

Avatars are circles by default, since `rounded` defaults to `pill` like shadcn. Set `rounded` to `xs` through `4xl` for a rounded square instead.

<Demo section="rounded" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Avatar rounded="pill">
	<AvatarImage src="https://github.com/shadcn.png" alt="@shadcn" />
	<AvatarFallback>CN</AvatarFallback>
</Avatar>
```

## API

`Avatar` and `AvatarFallback` extend the native `span` attributes, and `AvatarImage` extends the native `img` attributes. Extra attributes and event handlers pass through to each element, and `onload` and `onerror` still fire on the image.

```ts title="index.ts"
interface Props extends CompPropsWithChild<"span"> {
	/** Visual style of the background and border */
	variant?: "default" | "secondary" | "outline";
	/** Size on the shared scale; defaults to `sm`, a 32 pixel avatar like shadcn */
	size?: UiSize;
	/** Corner radius; defaults to `pill`, a circle like shadcn */
	rounded?: UiRounded;
}

interface ImageProps extends CompProps<"img"> {}

interface FallbackProps extends CompPropsWithChild<"span"> {}
```
